/a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#contact\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-black\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Hero -->\\n  <section class=\\\"py-28\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"space-y-8\\\">\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight\\\">\\n          Senior Software Developer<br>\\n          building scalable products\\n        </h1>\\n\\n        <p class=\\\"text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n          I’m a senior mobile and full-stack developer with 9+ years of experience\\n          building high-performance applications across mobile and web.\\n          I specialize in React Native, React, and modern system architecture.\\n        </p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"#contact\\\"\\n             class=\\\"px-6 py-3 bg-black text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-medium\\\">\\n            Contact Me\\n          </a>\\n          <a href=\\\"https://portfolio-ayyam.vercel.app/\\\"\\n             class=\\\"px-6 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg text-sm\\\">\\n            View Portfolio\\n          </a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <img\\n        src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?q=80&w=1200\\\"\\n        alt=\\\"Profile\\\"\\n        class=\\\"rounded-xl object-cover w-full h-[420px]\\\"\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- About -->\\n  <section id=\\\"about\\\" class=\\\"py-24 bg-white\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-semibold\\\">About</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n        I focus on designing and building systems that scale — technically and\\n        operationally. Over the years, I’ve worked across healthcare,\\n        e-commerce, and enterprise platforms, delivering maintainable,\\n        production-grade applications.\\n      </p>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- Skills -->\\n  <section id=\\\"skills\\\" class=\\\"py-24\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-semibold\\\">Skills</h2>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border\\\">\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-medium\\\">React Native</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\\\">iOS & Android apps</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border\\\">\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-medium\\\">React / Next.js</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\\\">Web platforms</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border\\\">\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-medium\\\">TypeScript</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\\\">Large codebases</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border\\\">\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-medium\\\">AWS & Docker</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\\\">Cloud & deployment</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- Experience -->\\n  <section id=\\\"experience\\\" class=\\\"py-24 bg-white\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-semibold\\\">Experience</h2>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"space-y-8\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Senior Software Developer</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\\\">\\n            Led development of scalable mobile and web applications using\\n            React Native and Next.js, focusing on performance and maintainability.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Lead Mobile Developer</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\\\">\\n            Architected multiple React Native applications with complex state\\n            management and backend integrations.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <h4 class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Full Stack Developer</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\\\">\\n            Delivered end-to-end features including APIs, authentication,\\n            notifications, and payment flows.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- Contact -->\\n  <section id=\\\"contact\\\" class=\\\"py-24\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-semibold\\\">Contact</h2>\\n\\n      <form class=\\\"grid gap-6 bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border\\\">\\n        <input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Name\\\"\\n          class=\\\"border px-4 py-3 rounded-lg\\\" />\\n        <input type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\"\\n          class=\\\"border px-4 py-3 rounded-lg\\\" />\\n        <textarea rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Message\\\"\\n          class=\\\"border px-4 py-3 rounded-lg\\\"></textarea>\\n        <button class=\\\"bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm\\\">\\n          Send Message\\n        </button>\\n      </form>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"py-10 text-center text-sm text-gray-500\\\">\\n    © 2025 Ayyamperumal. All rights reserved.\\n  </footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\" }} />\n  );\n}\n",
